        <div id="repairSchedAvailable" style="display:none;">
          <div class="alert alert-success py-3" style="border-radius:10px;">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill me-2"></i><strong>Technician is available!</strong>
            <p class="mb-2 mt-1" style="font-size:0.85rem;">Remaining working hours are sufficient. Ready to start
